assets/images/loadscreens/*.png

# RenegadeViewer exports and terminal pictures: kept locally, converted with tools/convert_maps.py
/[0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_*/
/customMap/
